<heading>list - List all categories.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  list
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists all categories of the ABC library with their ids, sorted
alphabetically.
</paragraph>

